{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54500","headline":"兵要望江南 风角第二（辛本作「占风角第二」、京本作「占风第三」。三十三首） 二十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 风角第二（辛本作「占风角第二」、京本作「占风第三」。三十三首） 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纳音土，欲得角来风。\n土是客军水（京本作「本」）是主，风从己亥发来冲，客败主收功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}